<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
{{!--
  Shared frame for every KTE e-mail. Email rules, not page rules:
  - Arial only (clients do not load web fonts; the brand is the header band).
  - Tables + inline styles + bgcolor/width attributes (Outlook = Word engine: no flex, grid,
    float, position, max-width, background-image, reliable padding on <a>).
  - Colours are the site tokens, written out (email has no CSS variables):
      brand-deep #4a1d6a, brand-tint #f3edf8, ink #14121a, muted #5b5566, border #efecf3,
      amber-bg #fbf1e0 / amber-edge #f0dcb8 / amber-ink #6b4100.
  - Amber band is #8A5300 (a deeper amber-icon) so white text keeps AA contrast.
  Params: preheader (inbox preview text), amber (true => amber band), footerNote (plain text).
--}}
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light" />
<title>{{subject}}</title>
<!--[if mso]>
<xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:AllowPNG/><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml>
<![endif]-->
<style type="text/css">
  body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; -ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }
  table, td { mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; }
  img { border:0; outline:none; text-decoration:none; -ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; }
  @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
    .kte-px { padding-left:20px !important; padding-right:20px !important; }
    .kte-stack { display:block !important; width:100% !important; box-sizing:border-box; }
    .kte-label { padding-bottom:0 !important; }
    .kte-cta { width:100% !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; width:100%; background-color:#f3f1f6;" bgcolor="#f3f1f6">
{{#if preheader}}<div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f3f1f6;">{{preheader}}&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;&#8199;&#847;</div>{{/if}}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f3f1f6" style="background-color:#f3f1f6;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

  <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">

    <!-- Header band: brand mark + product name -->
    <tr>
      <td class="kte-px" bgcolor="{{#if amber}}#8A5300{{else}}#4a1d6a{{/if}}" style="background-color:{{#if amber}}#8A5300{{else}}#4a1d6a{{/if}}; padding:20px 32px;">
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td width="40" height="40" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="width:40px; height:40px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:40px; font-weight:bold; color:{{#if amber}}#8A5300{{else}}#4a1d6a{{/if}};">KTE</td>
            <td style="padding-left:12px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:24px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff;">KTE Jegyportál</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- White body -->
    <tr>
      <td class="kte-px" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="background-color:#ffffff; padding:32px 32px 28px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#14121a;">
        {{> @partial-block}}
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Grey footer -->
    <tr>
      <td class="kte-px" bgcolor="#ece9f0" style="background-color:#ece9f0; padding:20px 32px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:19px; color:#5b5566;">
        {{#if footerNote}}<p style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#14121a;">{{footerNote}}</p>{{/if}}
        <p style="margin:0;">Ezt az automatikus levelet a KTE Jegyportál küldte, kérjük, ne válaszolj rá.<br />Kecskeméti TE &middot; KTE Jegyportál</p>
      </td>
    </tr>

  </table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
